---
import SiteLayout from "@layouts/SiteLayout.astro";
---

<SiteLayout
  title="Soul Charters – Good job."
  description="Design and development work by John Basham."
  home={false}
>
  <div class="archive-page">
    <article
      class="category-case-study format-standard has-post-thumbnail hentry post post-305 status-publish tag-animated-logo tag-website type-post"
      id="post-305"
      itemprop="blogPost"
      itemscope
      itemtype="https://schema.org/BlogPosting"
      role="article"
    >
      <header class="article-header entry-header">
        <div class="post-tag">
          <span>Animated Logo</span>
        </div>
        <div class="post-tag">
          <span>Website</span>
        </div>
        <div class="post-cat">
          <span>Case Study</span>
        </div>
        <h1 class="entry-title single-title" itemprop="headline">
          Soul Charters
        </h1>
      </header>
      <section class="entry-content" itemprop="articleBody">
        <div class="featured-image">
          <label for="expand-toggle" id="expand-image">
            <img
              alt=""
              class="attachment-full size-full wp-post-image"
              decoding="async"
              fetchpriority="high"
              height="1220"
              sizes="(max-width: 1790px) 100vw, 1790px"
              src="/uploads/2019/06/soul-charters-home.png"
              srcset="
                  /uploads/2019/06/soul-charters-home.png          1790w,
                  /uploads/2019/06/soul-charters-home-300x204.png   300w,
                  /uploads/2019/06/soul-charters-home-768x523.png   768w,
                  /uploads/2019/06/soul-charters-home-1024x698.png 1024w
                "
              width="1790"
            />
          </label>
        </div>
        <p class="has-small-font-size">
          <strong>Website</strong>:
          <a href="https://www.soulcharters.com/">www.soulcharters.com</a>
          <br />
          <strong>Services:</strong> website, branding
        </p>
        <p>A website re-brand and re-design.</p>
        <p>
          The founders Athena and Leone have a unique business facilitating
          yacht chartered retreats to retreat facilitators. The key goals were
          to:
        </p>
        <ul class="wp-block-list">
          <li>
            create a modern and captivating website that exudes how deeply the
            pair care about their work
          </li>
          <li>validates the concept of yacht charter retreats</li>
          <li>informs retreat facilitators the benefits of sea retreats</li>
          <li>grow leads from facilitators</li>
        </ul>
        <p>
          So from the get go we had a lot of information to communicate to the
          audience. Once the content was established it was clear the importance
          of making the website very easy to read; there were large amounts of
          text to read.
        </p>
        <p>
          This resulted in designing parameters that offered an optimal reading
          experience. Approximately 15 words per line, legible font and font
          size, as well as a comfortable line height to allow for ease of
          reading. There is a lot of breathing space around text so the page
          never feels busy.
        </p>
        <p>
          Creating a mood was the other big aspect. The website needed to be
          very captivating. As retreats are about self-discovery and growth I
          needed to capture this atmosphere. Using full screen photos, cropped
          and edited to create a dreamlike state that complements the
          storytelling in the copy.
        </p>
        <p>
          <strong>Technical details:</strong>
          <br />
          – custom built theme for the wordpress content management system.
          <br />– html, css, php, sass, css grid, svg animation
        </p>
        <figure class="wp-block-image">
          <img
            alt=""
            class="wp-image-310"
            decoding="async"
            height="557"
            sizes="(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px"
            src="/uploads/2019/06/home-welcome-section-1024x557.jpg"
            srcset="
                /uploads/2019/06/home-welcome-section-1024x557.jpg 1024w,
                /uploads/2019/06/home-welcome-section-300x163.jpg   300w,
                /uploads/2019/06/home-welcome-section-768x418.jpg   768w,
                /uploads/2019/06/home-welcome-section.jpg          1200w
              "
            width="1024"
          />
        </figure>
        <figure class="wp-block-image">
          <img
            alt=""
            class="wp-image-309"
            decoding="async"
            height="548"
            sizes="(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px"
            src="/uploads/2019/06/home-process-section-1024x548.jpg"
            srcset="
                /uploads/2019/06/home-process-section-1024x548.jpg 1024w,
                /uploads/2019/06/home-process-section-300x161.jpg   300w,
                /uploads/2019/06/home-process-section-768x411.jpg   768w,
                /uploads/2019/06/home-process-section.jpg          1200w
              "
            width="1024"
          />
        </figure>
        <figure class="wp-block-image">
          <img
            alt=""
            class="wp-image-307"
            decoding="async"
            height="463"
            loading="lazy"
            sizes="(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px"
            src="/uploads/2019/06/contact-1024x463.jpg"
            srcset="
                /uploads/2019/06/contact-1024x463.jpg 1024w,
                /uploads/2019/06/contact-300x136.jpg   300w,
                /uploads/2019/06/contact-768x347.jpg   768w,
                /uploads/2019/06/contact.jpg          1200w
              "
            width="1024"
          />
        </figure>
        <figure class="wp-block-image">
          <img
            alt=""
            class="wp-image-306"
            decoding="async"
            height="538"
            loading="lazy"
            sizes="(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px"
            src="/uploads/2019/06/about-1024x538.jpg"
            srcset="
                /uploads/2019/06/about-1024x538.jpg 1024w,
                /uploads/2019/06/about-300x158.jpg   300w,
                /uploads/2019/06/about-768x404.jpg   768w,
                /uploads/2019/06/about.jpg          1200w
              "
            width="1024"
          />
        </figure>
      </section>
    </article>
  </div>
</SiteLayout>
